{"strongs": "H0387", "word": "אֵיתָן", "translit": "e.tan", "root": "יתן", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "a wise man", "definition": "II. אֵיתָן proper name, masculine a wise man 1Kgs 5:11 (where called הָאֶזְרָחִי ) named with הֵימָן , כַּלְכֹּל , דַּרְדַּע ; compare 1Chr 2:6 (where these 4 with זִמְרִי are בְּנֵי זֶרַח ); also 1Chr 2:8 ; 1Chr 6:27 called בֶּןקִֿישִׁי 1Chr 6:29 = בֶּןקֿוּשָׁיָ֫הוּ 1Chr 15:17 where, and v 1Chr 15:19 , named as Levitical singer with הֵימָן and אָסָף (q. v.; יְדוּתוּן for אֵיתָן in this group 1Chr 25:1 ; 1Chr 25:6 ; 2Chr 5:12 ; 2Chr 35:15 , see ידותון ); לְאֵיתָן הָאֶזְרָחִי Ps 89:1 (title). יַתְנִיאֵל see תנה .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3848')\">BDB3848</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H387')\">H387</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3847')\">BDB3847</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3849')\">BDB3849</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>אֵיתָן</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <highlightword>a wise man</highlightword> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,11)\">1Kgs 5:11</ref> (where called <bdbheb>הָאֶזְרָחִי</bdbheb>) named with <bdbheb>הֵימָן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>כַּלְכֹּל</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>דַּרְדַּע</bdbheb>; compare <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,6)\">1Chr 2:6</ref> (where these 4 with <bdbheb>זִמְרִי</bdbheb> are <bdbheb>בְּנֵי זֶרַח</bdbheb>); also <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,8)\">1Chr 2:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:27\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,27)\">1Chr 6:27</ref> called <bdbheb>בֶּןקִֿישִׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:29\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,29)\">1Chr 6:29</ref> = <bdbheb>בֶּןקֿוּשָׁיָ֫הוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,17)\">1Chr 15:17</ref> where, and v<ref ref=\"1Chr 15:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,19)\">1Chr 15:19</ref>, named as Levitical singer with <bdbheb>הֵימָן</bdbheb> and  <bdbheb><reflink>אָסָף</reflink></bdbheb> (q. v.; <bdbheb>יְדוּתוּן</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>אֵיתָן</bdbheb> in this group <ref ref=\"1Chr 25:1\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,1)\">1Chr 25:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 25:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,6)\">1Chr 25:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,12)\">2Chr 5:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,15)\">2Chr 35:15</ref>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>ידותון</reflink></bdbheb>); <bdbheb>לְאֵיתָן הָאֶזְרָחִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 89:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,1)\">Ps 89:1</ref> (title). </p><hr><p><bdbheb>יַתְנִיאֵל</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>תנה</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Kgs 5:11", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 5, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "1Chr 2:6", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 2, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "1Chr 2:8", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 2, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "1Chr 6:27", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 6, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "1Chr 6:29", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 6, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "1Chr 15:17", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 15, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "1Chr 15:19", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 15, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "1Chr 25:1", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 25, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "1Chr 25:6", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 25, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "2Chr 5:12", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 5, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "2Chr 35:15", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 35, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Ps 89:1", "book": "PSA", "cha